2","title":"Keep a water and rain plan","destination_id":"SG-MAC","category":"packing","description":"Carry drinking water and a compact rain layer for outdoor routes.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-003","title":"Treat hawker centres as flexible meals","destination_id":"SG-CHN","category":"food","description":"Choose open stalls and ask about ingredients where allergies matter.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-004","title":"Leave time between airport and city plans","destination_id":"SG-CHG","category":"logistics","description":"Allow a generous buffer for immigration, luggage and airline check-in.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-005","title":"Use public transport for central districts","destination_id":"SG-CBD","category":"transport","description":"Check current routes and service notices before setting out.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-006","title":"Respect places of worship","destination_id":"SG-LTL","category":"culture","description":"Check entry guidance and ask before photographing people.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-007","title":"Check timed-ticket rules","destination_id":"SG-SEN","category":"booking","description":"Verify current ticketing and capacity rules with the attraction.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-008","title":"Check trail status before hiking","destination_id":"SG-BUK","category":"safety","description":"Follow posted closures and weather advisories.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-009","title":"Carry a suitable payment method","destination_id":"SG-BED","category":"payments","description":"Payment methods vary by stall and business.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-010","title":"Keep an indoor alternative for evenings","destination_id":"SG-CLK","category":"timing","description":"Rain and visibility can affect waterfront plans.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-011","title":"Confirm bicycle rental conditions","destination_id":"SG-ECP","category":"active","description":"Check helmet availability, route rules and return arrangements.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-012","title":"Plan island transport both ways","destination_id":"SG-PUL","category":"logistics","description":"Confirm bumboat arrangements and keep a return-time buffer.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-013","title":"Verify accessibility directly","destination_id":"SG-SEN","category":"accessibility","description":"Step-free access differs by venue, route and transport.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-014","title":"Keep a slower option for children","destination_id":"SG-WDL","category":"family","description":"Add snack, shade and rest breaks and check age restrictions.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-015","title":"Ask before photographing residents","destination_id":"SG-LTL","category":"respect","description":"Be considerate in residential streets, markets and religious settings.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-016","title":"Check public holiday opening hours","destination_id":"SG-CHN","category":"planning","description":"Some businesses change hours or close on public holidays.","editorial_note":"General planning guidance; verify conditions close to travel."},{"id":"REC-017","title":"Leave roo